fixture tech11_ember_stops_on_floor
doc BUILD.md s6 Ember Toss "press again to teleport to it"; docs/adr/0010 teleport fit
room test/flat
spawn 400 544
frames 60
input
  # Thrown down-forward, the ember stops on the floor; the teleport stands the player on it.
  0 D R toss
  40 toss
end
expect
  at 30 ember=1 ember_y>=543u
  at 40 event.teleport=1 ember=0 y>=543u y<=544u invuln=1
  mark land 40..41 ground=1
end
